{"kind": "mod", "id": 2189, "name": "Eukyre's Vinyl Records", "slug": "eukyres-vinyl-records", "teaser": "\"When you gonna Learn?\"", "owner_name": "probablyEukyre", "downloads": 1863, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:00:47.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-06-16T16:53:35.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-06-16T16:53:35.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.11.0", "latest_version": "1.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>This mod adds various 12-inch vinyl LP records based on artists that I myself made and others (Turok, Hoshizoraa, RheddElBozo) recommended.</p>\n<p>This mod will be continually updated with the planned records until completion.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YRc4yHf.png\" alt=\"YRc4yHf.png\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgur.com/vKRw58b.gif\" alt=\"vKRw58b.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Contents</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Currently this mod contains:<br />\n- A Vinyl Storage Case to hold these collectibles<br />\n- Bocchi The Rock! Records 1 and 2<br />\n- King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard’s Teenage Gizzard LP<br />\n- CASIOPEA’s Mint Jams (Standard &amp; Green Vinyl)<br />\n- Alfie Templeman’s Mellow Moon (Pink Vinyl)<br />\n- Alfie Templeman’s Radiosoul (Rare Printed Vinyl)<br />\n- Weezer’s Blue Album<br />\n- Yes’ Fragile (Original 1970s vinyl)<br />\n- Jamiroquai’s Travelling Without Moving (Deluxe Vinyl)</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YRc4yHf.png\" alt=\"YRc4yHf.png\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Planned</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>You can find my planned additions for this mod here: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://trello.com/c/QgrbfB9Q\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://trello.com/c/QgrbfB9Q</a></p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1863, "published_at": "2025-06-16T16:53:35.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2189/eukyres-vinyl-records/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "source_code_links": []}